Signing helpers (design):

- Funciones:
  - compute_huella_verifactu(payload) -> hex SHA256
  - sign_xml_element(element, key_path, cert_path, id_attr='Id') -> signed element
  - sign_using_xmlsec_cli(file_in, key, cert) -> signed bytes (fallback)

- Observaciones:
  - registrar attribute Id con xmlsec.tree.add_ids(...)
  - mantener orden de elementos (Signature al final de RegistroAlta)
